Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||09-17-1999||09:03 AM||||I just received and installed my ultimate dogbone last night and WOW what a difference.  I never knew how sloppy and shot my old dogbone was compared to this one.  it commpletely changed the feel of the drive.  I have a little more vibration during idle, but I knew I was going to have that.  I have heard the vibration is worse in a 4banger.  <P>I just couldn't believe the difference.  I feel like the car responds better.  Maybe it's just me, but it sure feels different!!!||||reg||14
Z||000001||JIM GOOSE||09-17-1999||09:27 AM|||| I second that motion,must be the response time is so much quicker.  Also used to get a little twitch when banging the gears & now seems to be gone. I subbed 7/16" bolts for the stock ones.||||reg||1
